  "slug": "contact-us",
  "title": "Contact Us",
  "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-b846c9c7 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container__shape uagb-container__shape-bottom uagb-container__invert\" data-negative=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 10\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path class=\"uagb-container__shape-fill\" d=\"M350,10L340,0h20L350,10z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-070b664c uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Contact Us.​</h2></div></div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-bdfc7997 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-d39a3a1a\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-6d50aeae wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reflection-Cooking-Joy-www.garndmarecipe.com_.jpg ,https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reflection-Cooking-Joy-www.garndmarecipe.com_.jpg 780w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reflection-Cooking-Joy-www.garndmarecipe.com_.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reflection-Cooking-Joy-www.garndmarecipe.com_.jpg\" alt=\"Elderly woman in a floral apron holds a spoon and smiles while cooking near a window-lit stove.\" class=\"uag-image-2297\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" title=\"Reflection -Cooking Joy www.garndmarecipe.com\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"/></figure></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-24e87115\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I’m <strong>Grandma Millie</strong>, and I hope this cozy kitchen corner feels like home—full of love, laughter, and recipes passed down from flour-dusted counters and handwritten cards, like my famous cinnamon rolls, chicken pot pie, and can’t-ever-change-the-recipe biscuits.<br>>> See more <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/about-us/\">about me</a></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-b4evs3gg alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-qqolu6si\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-cofvwe3e uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Contact Us</h2></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">We’d love to hear from you! Whether you have a question about a recipe, want to share a family favorite, or just want to say hello, we’re here to connect. At Grandma Recipe, we believe in building a warm, food-loving community — just like gathering around the kitchen table. Reach out anytime for collaborations, feedback, or simply to share your love for homemade cooking.<br><br>Learn more about GrandmaRecipe <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/about-us/\">here</a>.</p></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-c8bi3nsa uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"><path d=\"M464 64C490.5 64 512 85.49 512 112C512 127.1 504.9 141.3 492.8 150.4L275.2 313.6C263.8 322.1 248.2 322.1 236.8 313.6L19.2 150.4C7.113 141.3 0 127.1 0 112C0 85.49 21.49 64 48 64H464zM217.6 339.2C240.4 356.3 271.6 356.3 294.4 339.2L512 176V384C512 419.3 483.3 448 448 448H64C28.65 448 0 419.3 0 384V176L217.6 339.2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Email</p></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\"><a href=\"mailto:contact@grandmarecipe.com\">contact@grandmarecipe.com</a></p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-forms uagb-forms__outer-wrap uagb-block-n4wawa2y uagb-forms__default-btn\"><form class=\"uagb-forms-main-form\" method=\"post\" autocomplete=\"on\" name=\"uagb-form-n4wawa2y\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-forms-name uagb-forms-name-wrap uagb-forms-field-set uagb-block-c9zommxn uag-col-2\"><div class=\"uagb-forms-name-label required uagb-forms-input-label\" id=\"c9zommxn\">First Name</div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"\" required class=\"uagb-forms-name-input uagb-forms-input\" name=\"c9zommxn\" autocomplete=\"given-name\"/></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-forms-name uagb-forms-name-wrap uagb-forms-field-set uagb-block-9ak6bcz2 uag-col-2\"><div class=\"uagb-forms-name-label required uagb-forms-input-label\" id=\"9ak6bcz2\">Last Name</div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"\" required class=\"uagb-forms-name-input uagb-forms-input\" name=\"9ak6bcz2\" autocomplete=\"family-name\"/></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-forms-email uagb-forms-email-wrap uagb-forms-field-set uagb-block-axpmyplv\"><div class=\"uagb-forms-email-label required uagb-forms-input-label\" id=\"axpmyplv\">Email</div><input type=\"email\" class=\"uagb-forms-email-input uagb-forms-input\" placeholder=\"\" required name=\"axpmyplv\" autocomplete=\"email\"/></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-forms-textarea uagb-forms-textarea-wrap uagb-forms-field-set uagb-block-0z0jjv0u\"><div class=\"uagb-forms-textarea-label required uagb-forms-input-label\" id=\"0z0jjv0u\">Message</div><textarea required class=\"uagb-forms-textarea-input uagb-forms-input\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"\" name=\"0z0jjv0u\" autocomplete=\"off\"></textarea></div>\n<div class=\"uagb-forms-form-hidden-data\"><input type=\"hidden\" class=\"uagb_forms_form_label\" value=\"Spectra Form\"/><input type=\"hidden\" class=\"uagb_forms_form_id\" value=\"uagb-form-n4wawa2y\"/></div><div class=\"uagb-form-reacaptcha-error-n4wawa2y\"></div><div class=\"uagb-forms-main-submit-button-wrap wp-block-button\"><button class=\"uagb-forms-main-submit-button wp-block-button__link\"><div class=\"uagb-forms-main-submit-button-text\">Submit Form</div></button></div></form><div class=\"uagb-forms-success-message-n4wawa2y uagb-forms-submit-message-hide\"><span>The form has been submitted successfully!</span></div><div class=\"uagb-forms-failed-message-n4wawa2y uagb-forms-submit-message-hide\"><span>There has been some error while submitting the form. Please verify all form fields again.</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n"
